	(text "HARDWARE TIMEOUT (74HCT4538 @ 5V)\nRelay ON = GPIO high AND < T since rising edge\nT = 0.7 x Rext x Cext = 0.7 x 1M x 10uF = ~7 s\n(Tasmota PulseTime 3.0 / 3.5 s is always shorter)\nR9/R10 1k: protect ESP GPIO if 5V rail is off (USB only)\nR11/R12 100R: TI rapid power-down protection for Cext\n\nRELAY DRIVERS\nQ -> R7/R8 1k -> 2N2222A (R13/R14 10k base pull-down)\nD4/D5 1N4007 flyback across each coil\nR15/R16 1k + D6/D7 red LED: lit while the relay is energised\nFail-safe: Q low / U2 unpowered -> coil off -> NC closed"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 58.42 0)
